 18   4010              ; The frame loop: isr counts the frames; the main loop waits with HALT, sends
 19   4010              ; the herd after the paper, moves it a pixel for every frame counted, and does
 20   4010              ; a work in turn of these T-states:
 21   4010              ; 3,000, 30,000, 3,000, 45,000, 3,000, 57,000, 3,000, 78,000.
